{"reference":"Jeremiah 24","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":24,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Wider Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 24 stands within a received book that brings together poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. The common outline that places chapters 2–25 together is a practical way of navigating the book, though it does not settle how the book came to be composed.","confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_024_f8023e8a55342fb162313386"]}]}],"generated_metadata":null}